      "UIHeader": {
        "id": "UIHeader",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "# The irrationality of $\\sqrt{2}$\n\n**Assumptions**\n\n- No additional assumptions are required.\n\n**Statement / basic definitions**\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2}\\notin\\mathbb{Q}\n$$\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/index|Overview and background]] · Proved (mathematical conclusion)",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "H1": {
        "id": "H1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| H1 | HYPOTHESIS_LOCAL |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Assume rationality\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{2}\\in\\mathbb{Q}\n$$\n\nSuppose $\\sqrt{2}\\in\\mathbb{Q}$ for contradiction.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/H1|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/H1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/H1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "K1": {
        "id": "K1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| K1 | KNOWN_RESULT |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Reduced fraction theorem\n\nA rational number has a reduced integer fraction.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/K1|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/K1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/K1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "K2": {
        "id": "K2",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| K2 | KNOWN_RESULT |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Parity of squares\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall z\\in\\mathbb{Z},\\\\\n&\\quad 2\\mid z^2\\\\\n&\\qquad\\Rightarrow 2\\mid z\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAn integer with an even square is even.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/K2|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/K2#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/K2#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "D1": {
        "id": "D1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| D1 | DEFINITION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Square root property\n\n$$\n(\\sqrt{2})^2=2\n$$\n\nThe positive square root has square equal to two.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/D1|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/D1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/D1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "R1": {
        "id": "R1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| R1 | DERIVATION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Reduced representation exists\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists m,n\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\\\\n&\\quad\\text{such that}\\quad\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\n&n>0\\\\\n&\\gcd(m,n)=1\\\\\n&\\sqrt{2}=m/n\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nA reduced fraction represents $\\sqrt{2}$.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R1|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "L1": {
        "id": "L1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| L1 | LOCAL_INTRODUCTION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Choose reduced witnesses\n\n$$\na,b\\in\\mathbb{Z}\n$$\n\nSelect a reduced numerator and denominator.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/L1|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/L1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/L1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "R2": {
        "id": "R2",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| R2 | DERIVATION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Witness conditions\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\n&a,b\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\\\\n&b>0\\\\\n&\\gcd(a,b)=1\\\\\n&\\sqrt{2}=a/b\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe chosen fraction is reduced and represents $\\sqrt{2}$.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R2|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R2#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R2#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "R3": {
        "id": "R3",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| R3 | DERIVATION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Square relation\n\n$$\na^2=2b^2\n$$\n\nThe numerator square equals twice the denominator square.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R3|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R3#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R3#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "R4": {
        "id": "R4",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| R4 | DERIVATION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Even numerator\n\n$$\n2\\mid a\n$$\n\nThe chosen numerator is divisible by two.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R4|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R4#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R4#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "R5": {
        "id": "R5",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| R5 | DERIVATION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Even denominator square\n\n$$\n2\\mid b^2\n$$\n\nThe denominator square is divisible by two.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R5|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R5#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R5#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "R6": {
        "id": "R6",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| R6 | DERIVATION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Even denominator\n\n$$\n2\\mid b\n$$\n\nThe chosen denominator is divisible by two.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R6|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R6#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/R6#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "X1": {
        "id": "X1",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| X1 | CONTRADICTION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Coprimality contradiction\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}\n&\\gcd(a,b)=1\\\\\n&\\gcd(a,b)\\ge 2\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe greatest common divisor is both one and at least two.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/X1|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/X1#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/X1#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "X2": {
        "id": "X2",
        "type": "text",
        "text": "| X2 | CONTRADICTION |\n| :--- | ---: |\n\n### Witness-free contradiction\n\n$$\n\\bot\n$$\n\nThe contradiction no longer depends on particular witnesses.\n\n---\n\n[[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/X2|Details]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/X2#Incoming relations|Incoming]] · [[note/sqrt-2-irrationality/X2#Outgoing relations|Outgoing]]",
        "label": null,
        "file": null,
        "subpath": null
      },
      "T1": {
